---
import { assetPath } from '../../utils/assets';
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="page-section loop-section">
  <div class="section-heading split-heading">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">01 / The actual loop</div>
      <h2>Hunt. Catch.<br /><em>Check your dex.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p>PokéCatch runs one command at a time. Find a pending wild Pokémon, resolve the encounter with a ball, then inspect the collection that remains saved between invocations.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="steps-grid">
    <article class="step-card card">
      <div class="step-number">01</div>
      <div class="step-icon"><img src={assetPath('assets/sprites/bulbasaur.png')} alt="Bulbasaur sprite" /></div>
      <h3>Generate the encounter</h3>
      <p>Run <code>pokecatch hunt</code> to create or replace one pending wild Pokémon, whether that turns up Bulbasaur or another species. A successful hunt grants 5 XP.</p>
      <div class="step-foot"><span class="badge badge-soft">15s between successful hunts</span></div>
    </article>
    <article class="step-card card step-featured">
      <div class="step-number">02</div>
      <div class="step-icon"><img src={assetPath('assets/sprites/pikachu.png')} alt="Pikachu sprite" /></div>
      <h3>Resolve the catch</h3>
      <p>Use <code>pokecatch catch &lt;ball&gt;</code>—for example <code>catch pb</code> or <code>catch net</code>. One available ball is spent and the encounter ends on either outcome.</p>
      <div class="step-foot"><span class="badge badge-soft">pb · net · mb aliases</span></div>
    </article>
    <article class="step-card card">
      <div class="step-number">03</div>
      <div class="step-icon"><img src={assetPath('assets/sprites/mew.png')} alt="Mew sprite" /></div>
      <h3>Check your Pokédex</h3>
      <p>Run <code>pokecatch pokedex</code> or its <code>dex</code> alias. Try <code>dex "Pikachu"</code>, filter by type or rarity, or page through 20 unique species.</p>
      <div class="step-foot"><span class="badge badge-soft">pokedex = dex</span></div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
